<title>USA: TABLE-Palm Harbor Homes Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Palm Harbor Homes Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qtr Ended</p>
<p>				     Jun 27, 1997	  Jun 28, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales			$ 159,097,000	 $ 120,735,000</p>
<p> Net income			   7,668,000	     5,464,000</p>
<p> Net income per share		    0.51		  0.40/a</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding    15,100,000	  13,656,000/a</p>
<p>NOTE: a/Share and per share figures for the quarter ended June 28, 1996 have been adjusted to reflect the 5-for-4 stock split distributed to shareholders on August 2, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
